                                                "sense_id": "2829f74c-8278-3733-8b0d-a069940e0c0f",
                                                "text": "Surprisingly few men are lacking in capacity, but they fail because they are lacking in application. Either they never learn how to work, or, having learned, they are too indolent to apply themselves with the seriousness and the attention that is necessary to solve important problems."
                                            }
